node_modules/
lib/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
dist/
.pnpm-store/
# Session residue (worktrees/, transcripts, settings.local.json) stays out, but
# .claude/settings.json is a tracked project file: it carries the Article II
# Edit/Write deny rules, which are worth nothing if each clone has to add them
# by hand. Spelled `.claude/*` rather than `.claude` because git cannot
# re-include a path whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded — the negation below
# only works if the directory itself is not the thing ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
